    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03c08e2ddb8647f508b145fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想以这个竞赛为目标，努力成长。\n所以，第一场竞赛该跑哪一场？",
      "source_fingerprint": "745b67f81abe5d7cb7ecaf4463e119ef1f022c3740167f3b4a09de2885d63eda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
