    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e139c7ab9908e5aec2adbb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然觉得有点心急，\n不过我也是早就趁着\n年末年初的时候想好了作战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68930d2a3f4d4086c6e4487f4906ed4dbd0c8a2d23a7e2e29393dbdd188b935",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
